## Dataset Licences

This project uses entirely synthetic data. No real patient data is included.

The following datasets are referenced as optional sanity checks only (not included):
- CGMacros (PhysioNet) — check licence at https://physionet.org before use
- BIG IDEAs Lab dataset (PhysioNet) — check licence at https://physionet.org before use
- Synthea sample data — Apache 2.0 licence (https://github.com/synthetichealth/synthea)

---

## Disclaimer

GlucoTwin is a student proof-of-concept built on synthetic data for the
Digital Twin Challenge 2026 (Happiest Health). It is not a medical device
and has not been clinically validated. No output of this system should be
used for patient care before review by qualified clinicians and applicable
regulators. All clinical decisions remain with the treating clinician.
